    <div class="marquee-item" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_5519.jpg" data-caption="Kayak dans la mangrove, sud de la Thaïlande" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/thumbs/IMG_5519-700.webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_5519.jpg" alt=""></picture><span class="cap">Kayak dans la mangrove</span></div>
